Z||000021||sqoach||02-12-2001||11:08 PM||||piece of cake, wasn't it? now, what do i get in return for all of my great advice? how bout your fiero? oh wait, then you wouldn't have anything to drive. i'll give ya the 87 topaz in return. hey, it's a 5 spd  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig2.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000022||fropuff||02-12-2001||11:13 PM||||Well, actually I have an 80 Cutlass winter car, but you're not getting the GT!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I will give you help if you need it in the future, however.  You were right about the stuff you said, though.  Thanks a lot, everyone for the help!  No more worrying for me, except for those pesky tickets!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Thanks again.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
Z||000023||Old Lar||02-13-2001||08:40 AM||||Be real careful during you first few years of driving.  I mean don't go getting any speeding tickets. In NY they will pull the driver's licence on youthful drivers who get speeding tickets.  <P>Congratulations.  Please put a bumper sticker on your car stating that you are a new driver so that we can all steer clear.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">||||reg||3
Z||000024||blayde8||02-13-2001||05:54 PM||||Congrats Fropuff!  See it's not that hard and we won't have to take the test again (hope not).  Just a tip now that you have your license don't do stupid things like trying to show off to your friends.  It's not worth it, just take it easy, follow the laws and make driving fun.  <BR> Oh, and be carefull around the school parking lot.  At my school there are a lot of stupid drivers, I've already seen 3 accidents in our school parking lot.  I'm sure there's been more.||||reg||6
Z||000025||TheFiero64||02-14-2001||02:26 PM||||Great to here you passed.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I knew you could do it. When I got mine I parallel parked into a tree and still passed. It was only the bumper that tapped it. The cop knew I was nervous and passed me anyway.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Wow I've already been driving for over 6 years.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A><p>[This message has been edited by TheFiero64 (edited 02-14-2001).]||||reg||10
